        "content": "**From idea to prototype in 30 minutes:** Galileo AI ($29/mo) is the fastest path from concept to testable prototype. Describe your app in 2-3 sentences (e.g., 'A food delivery app for Jakarta with GoPay integration and bike delivery tracking') and it generates every screen \u2014 splash, login, menu, cart, checkout, tracking. Export to Figma for refinement. Total time: 30 minutes for a 12-screen prototype that previously took 2-3 days. **Screenshot redesign:** Visily AI's killer feature for Asian designers is screenshot-to-mockup. Take a screenshot of a Shopee product page, upload to Visily, and get an editable wireframe you can redesign and customize. Perfect for competitive analysis and redesign proposals. **Multi-market app setups:** If you're building an app that launches in Thailand, Vietnam, and Indonesia simultaneously, sketch your wireframe on paper, photograph it with Uizard's free tier, then use the mockup to brief developers in all three markets. **From wireframe to website:** Framer AI is the fastest path to a live website. Describe 'A photography portfolio for a Hong Kong wedding photographer with Cantonese and English' and Framer generates a bilingual, responsive site with CMS."
