    "slug": "ai-ecommerce-product-photography-asia",
    "title": "Best AI Product Photography Tools for E-Commerce in Asia (2026): Zero Studio, Zero Hassle",
    "description": "Professional product photos drive 30% more sales \u2014 but studio photography is expensive. Discover the best AI product photography tools for Asian e-commerce sellers on Shopee, Lazada, Tokopedia, TikTok Shop, and Amazon. Background removal, virtual studio sets, AI models, and batch editing tested across 10 tools.",
    "excerpt": "Asian e-commerce sellers on Shopee, Lazada, and TikTok Shop are using AI product photography to create studio-quality images without a studio. We tested 10 tools for background removal, virtual models, batch editing, and Asian product aesthetics.",
    "date": "2026-05-26",
    "author": "Apifeny AI Team",
    "readingTime": "11 min read",
    "tags": [
      "ecommerce",
      "product-photography",
      "ai-tools",
