    "title": "AI-Powered Email Marketing for Small Businesses in Asia (2026)",
    "description": "Learn how to use Mailchimp AI, Brevo, and Sendinblue for email marketing targeting Asian markets. Master segmentation, automation, and A/B testing with practical examples for Singapore, Hong Kong, and SEA audiences.",
