        "id": "deep-dive",
        "type": "content",
        "title": "AI Inventory Features That Matter for Asian Businesses",
        "content": "**Demand forecasting for Asian seasons:** Chinese New Year, Songkran, Hari Raya, Diwali, 11.11, 12.12, and Lunar New Year each create massive demand spikes. Zoho Inventory's Zia AI can learn these patterns from your historical data and adjust reorder points automatically. A Thai supplement seller reduced stockouts by 60% just by feeding two years of historical data into Zia. **Multi-warehouse across borders:** If you hold inventory in Singapore (for fast SG delivery), Johor (for MY customers), and a third-party warehouse in Bangkok, you need tools that understand border costs. Cin7 Core and Zoho both support multi-warehouse inventory with different valuation methods for each location. **Cost of goods in multiple currencies:** A Vietnam-based seller importing raw materials from China, manufacturing in Binh Duong, and selling on Lazada Vietnam needs COGS tracking across CNY, VND, and USD. Zoho handles this natively at $19/mo; Cin7 does it at $249/mo. **Low stock = lost sales:** In Asian e-commerce, 11.11 and 12.12 generate 30-50% of annual revenue for many sellers. AI tools predict these spikes and recommend pre-ordering inventory 45-60 days ahead."
      },
