    "title": "AI-Powered Recruitment Tools for Asian Companies: 2026 Guide",
    "excerpt": "Asian companies face a unique hiring challenge \u2014 sourcing talent across fragmented platforms, multiple languages, and competitive markets. We review the best AI recruitment tools for Singapore, Hong Kong, Japan, Korea, and Southeast Asia.",
    "date": "2026-05-13",
    "author": "Captain",
