        "content": "**Singapore & Malaysia (Google dominant):** Full stack: Surfer SEO ($89/mo) for content optimization + Semrush ($140/mo) for keyword research and tracking. Content strategy: English primary, Malay/Chinese secondary. Focus on roundup posts and comparison articles \u2014 these rank above Shopee/Lazada pages. **Thailand (Google dominant, Thai language):** SE Ranking ($49/mo) for its better Thai keyword coverage + Neuron Writer ($49/mo) for content generation in English (translate to Thai manually or with DeepL). Focus on Google Discover optimization \u2014 Thais use Google Discover heavily on mobile. **Vietnam (Google + C\u1ed1c C\u1ed1c):** SE Ranking for keyword tracking + free C\u1ed1c C\u1ed1c Analytics for local search insights. Vietnamese users search in Vietnamese text and use C\u1ed1c C\u1ed1c for quick lookups. **Indonesia (Google, big on TikTok Search):** SE Ranking ($49/mo) for the best ID keyword database among budget tools. Emerging trend: optimize for TikTok Search, not just Google. AI tools don't cover TikTok SEO yet \u2014 do it manually by analyzing trending hashtags and keywords. **Hong Kong (Google + Baidu crossover):** Semrush for Google HK keywords + manual Baidu preparation (Chinese hosting, ICP license, simplified Chinese content). **South Korea (Naver dominant):** Skip Western AI SEO tools for Naver. Use Naver Advisor and N Analytics for Naver optimization. Use Semrush only for Google Korea audits."
