    "slug": "ai-edtech-asia-2026",
    "title": "Best AI Tools for Education Technology (EdTech) in Asia (2026): Complete Guide to 18+ Essential Tools Across 7 Categories",
    "description": "Discover 18+ AI tools transforming EdTech across Asia in 2026. From Khanmigo and ChatGPT to Squirrel AI and Practicle \u2014 compare 7 categories of AI for education across Singapore, India, China, Japan, South Korea, Vietnam, and the Philippines.",
    "excerpt": "From AI tutoring bots used by 10 million Indian students to adaptive learning platforms certified by Singapore's MOE \u2014 this comprehensive guide covers 18 real AI tools across 7 EdTech categories reshaping classrooms and online learning across Asia in 2026.",
    "date": "2026-06-01",
